`/app/lib/ansible/plugins/shell/powershell.py`
- Changed from: `rb"\x00_\x00x([\x00(a-fA-F0-9)]{8})\x00_"`
- Changed to: `rb"\x00_\x00x((?:\x00[0-9a-fA-F]){4})\x00_"`
- This explicitly matches UTF-16-BE byte sequences where each hex digit is 
preceded by `\x00`
- Ensures that valid Unicode escape sequences like `_x\u6100\u6200\u6300\u6400_`
are not incorrectly matched

