  if getattr(self._shell, "_IS_WINDOWS", False):
      stderr = _replace_stderr_clixml(stderr)
  ```
- **Reason:** Now handles CLIXML blocks anywhere in stderr, not just at the 
start.

## Requirements Met

✓ `_STRING_DESERIAL_FIND` regex explicitly matches UTF-16-BE byte sequences
